# /fix <issue>

`/fix` was renamed to `/change` and goes away in the next release: run `/change <issue>` from now on. For this run, tell the user once that the name changed, then do what `/change <issue>` does on the same issue: read the `SKILL.md` of the `change` skill, in the folder next to this skill's folder, and follow it.
